e":"normalPoster","type":"SERIES","url":"","style":{"image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk45/shows/a06aefd1-2c4c-4048-a3f1-7baab680b63a.jpg"},"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Related","section_type":"normalPoster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":19243,"title":"","description":"16","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Drama"],"id":19243,"type":"SERIES","title":"حبيبي دائما (مدبلج)","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk53/seasons/630dba2e-7ea5-41cd-adf9-133aa7455395.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk59/seasons/2a12dd28-1877-45fe-95c3-9633e1500a62.jpg","likes":454,"dislikes":20,"views":142885,"release_date":"1388361600000","season_number":1,"description":"Rangrasiya tells us the story of a village girl who is based on a rural village in Rajasthan and an BSD officer...who are met at an encounter by BSD army. It is told that the story is inspired from Shakespeare's famous work 'Othello'. The character of Othello is played by splendid actor #AshishSharma and the character Desdimona is played the versatile actor #SanayaIrani ...Both of them are portraying their roles very accurately... Within a short period of time the couple Paro-Rudra(PaRud) had build a place in every youngsters mind...Thanking COLORS TV and Saurabh Tewari for giving us a wonderful jodi..and I'm dedicating this video to the 'NEVER TOLD LOVE STORY' of PaRud.","rating":{"sources":[],"value":0,"age":"N/A"},"background_color":"","current_season_id":7758,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}